'''Ku-Money''' is a [[shop]] NPC in [[Tethys Hub]], [[The Black Shores]]. The shop is unlocked after completing the [[Hidden Between the Waves|Chapter I Act VIII]] of the [[Main Quest]].

{{Quote
| quote = KU-Money is a robotic overseer of personnel costs in the Black Shores, ensuring every team member receives the necessary funds for their missions.
| speaker = -Wuthering Geographic
}}

